      "name": "Actions",
      "rulesText": "Multiattack. The triceratops makes two Gore attacks.\n\nGore. Melee Attack Roll: +9, reach 5 ft. Hit: 19 (2d12 + 6) Piercing damage. If the target is Huge or smaller and the triceratops moved 20+ feet straight toward it immediately before the hit, the target takes an extra 9 (2d8) Piercing damage and has the Prone condition."
